<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR steady, 3-mo, 6-mo dip.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR steady, 3-mo, 6-mo dip.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) remained steady for the one-month maturity and dipped for the three- and six-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 21.28 percent, unchanged, while the three-month rate at 21.14 percent and the six-month rate at 21.00 percent, both down 0.01.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
